  <text x="855" y="543" font-size="11" fill="#333">Consumer (reads data from Kafka)</text>
  
  <text x="975" y="565" font-size="9" fill="#666" text-anchor="middle">Replication Factor = 2 (each partition has 2 copies)</text>
  
